04:38.800 --> 04:40.250
Pil Huoxiang Zhengqi.

04:41.630 --> 04:42.590
[Pil Huoxiang Zhengqi]

04:45.440 --> 04:45.710
[Gambar suspek Huo Zheng]

04:45.730 --> 04:46.460
[Waran Tangkap]

04:46.580 --> 04:48.830
[Pil Huoxiang Zhengqi]

04:51.560 --> 04:52.890
Se... selamat tinggal.

05:03.600 --> 05:04.300
