06:20.510 --> 06:21.310
Bertenang dulu.

06:21.310 --> 06:22.310
Semua ini salah awak.

06:22.310 --> 06:23.190
Jangan awak...

06:31.560 --> 06:32.240
Polis.

06:42.240 --> 06:42.880
Helo?

06:42.950 --> 06:43.760
Ada polis.

06:44.390 --> 06:45.250
Berhati-hati.

06:48.270 --> 06:48.920
Ada polis.

06:49.870 --> 06:50.630
Jangan ke depan lagi.

06:50.630 --> 06:51.360
Jangan ke depan lagi.

06:51.360 --> 06:52.390
Berhenti...

06:55.270 --> 06:55.870
Adakah...

06:56.950 --> 06:58.370
Adakah mereka datang demi kita?

06:58.370 --> 06:59.480
Tentulah.

06:59.500 --> 07:00.830
Jika tidak, kenapa ketua lari?

07:00.830 --> 07:02.540
Jangan tengok ke arah sana.

07:03.630 --> 07:04.090
Insurans.

07:04.090 --> 07:04.750
- Tuntut insurans.
- Tuntut insurans.

07:04.750 --> 07:05.560
Awak berkeras nak masuk.

07:05.560 --> 07:06.720
Semua orang ada insurans.

07:06.720 --> 07:08.250
- Bertenang.
- Lapor polis.

07:09.270 --> 07:10.240
Keadaan di sini memang perlu dikawal,

07:10.240 --> 07:10.830
